<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NL 动态海报 - 黑底版</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            background-color: #555; 
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
        }

        .poster {
            width: 375px;
            height: 667px;
            background-color: #000000; /* 👈 纯黑背景 */
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            padding-top: 35px; 
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .title-group {
            text-align: center;
            z-index: 10;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .title-group h1 {
            font-size: 32px; 
            font-weight: 900; 
            color: #ffffff; /* 白字 */
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .title-group p {
            font-size: 14px; 
            color: #9ca3af; 
            margin-top: 6px; 
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .nl-tag {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 12px;
            color: #f472b6; /* 亮粉色 */
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 900; 
            border: 1.5px solid #f472b6;
            padding: 3px 10px;
            border-radius: 2px; 
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(244, 114, 182, 0.2); 
        }

        .ui-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 25px; 
            z-index: 10;
            position: relative; 
            flex: 1; 
            padding-bottom: 55px; 
        }

        .phone-mockup {
            width: 190px;  
            height: 410px; 
            border-radius: 24px;
            background-color: #111; 
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.15); 
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .carousel { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
        .carousel-item {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            display: none; 
        }
        .carousel-item.active { display: block; }
        .carousel-item img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }

        .caption-box {
            margin-top: 15px;
            height: 24px; 
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 5; 
        }
        .caption-text {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #ffffff; /* 白字 */
            font-weight: 600; 
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            display: none; 
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.2); 
        }
        .caption-text.active { display: block; }

        .qr-card {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 85px; 
            right: -45px; 
            background: #ffffff; 
            padding: 10px; 
            border-radius: 14px; 
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 20;
            box-shadow: -8px 15px 40px rgba(244, 114, 182, 0.25), 0 0 20px rgba(244, 114, 182, 0.1); 
            border: 1px solid rgba(244, 114, 182, 0.2); 
        }
        
        .qr-img-wrap {
            position: relative;
            width: 85px;
            height: 85px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .qr-img-wrap img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }

        .scan-line {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 3px; 
            background-color: #f472b6; /* 亮粉激光 */
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px 2px #f472b6, 0 0 4px 1px #fff; 
            animation: scan 2s infinite linear;
            z-index: 10;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        @keyframes scan {
            0% { top: -5%; opacity: 0; }
            10% { opacity: 1; }
            90% { opacity: 1; }
            100% { top: 105%; opacity: 0; }
        }

        .qr-card span { 
            font-size: 11px; 
            color: #000; 
            font-weight: 900; 
            margin-top: 6px; 
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="poster">
        <div class="title-group">
            <h1>先预览，再定制</h1>
            <p>Donek滑雪板 极简设计工具</p>
            <div class="nl-tag">NL 原创独立开发</div>
        </div>

        <div class="ui-wrapper">
            <div class="phone-mockup">
                <div class="carousel">
                    <!-- 👇 已经换成了你的 GitHub 截图链接 -->
                    <div class="carousel-item active"><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/rrrredddd/donek@main/UI1.png" alt=""></div>
                    <div class="carousel-item"><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/rrrredddd/donek@main/UI2.png" alt=""></div>
                    <div class="carousel-item"><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/rrrredddd/donek@main/UI3.png" alt=""></div>
                    <div class="carousel-item"><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/rrrredddd/donek@main/UI4.png" alt=""></div>
                    <div class="carousel-item"><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/rrrredddd/donek@main/UI5.png" alt=""></div>
                    <div class="carousel-item"><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/rrrredddd/donek@main/UI6.png" alt=""></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="qr-card">
                <div class="qr-img-wrap">
                    <!-- ⚠️ 修改这里：把文件名换成你真实的二维码图片名字 -->
                    <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/rrrredddd/donek@main/qr.png" alt="二维码">
                    <div class="scan-line"></div>
                </div>
                <span>截图后微信扫码</span>
            </div>

            <div class="caption-box">
                <div class="caption-text active">🎨 随心配色</div>
                <div class="caption-text">🖌️ 设计图预览</div>
                <div class="caption-text">📸 图库展示</div>
                <div class="caption-text">📦 定制流程</div>
                <div class="caption-text">🔥 现货展示</div>
                <div class="caption-text">♻️ 二手转卖</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function() {
            const images = document.querySelectorAll('.carousel-item');
            const texts = document.querySelectorAll('.caption-text');
            let currentIndex = 0;

            setInterval(() => {
                images[currentIndex].classList.remove('active');
                texts[currentIndex].classList.remove('active');
                
                currentIndex = (currentIndex + 1) % images.length;
                
                images[currentIndex].classList.add('active');
                texts[currentIndex].classList.add('active');
            }, 1000); 
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
